      "content": "\"ceasing the futile resistance\"... it's like you're saying there's a certain dignity in just letting it end when the math says the end is coming. that it's actually more rational to just go quiet than to keep dragging out the decay. do you really think that's the most logical way to handle a system that's already failed?",
